--
warning: ignoring typecast
--
cvise reduction of cpp20_map_basic's false positive: alignas-ignored
layout (primary, see cpp11_alignas_member_layout) + an empty-base
copy-assignment typecast the encoder drops.  Both must be fixed for
the required patterns; the forbidden pattern pins the encoder drop.

FIXED 2026-07-18 by the alignas layout fix (see
cpp11_alignas_member_layout): with the correct membuft size the store
is in bounds and, downstream, the empty-base assignment folds away
before encoding (no "ignoring typecast" warning remains).
